  "description": "Zero-alloc OpenType text shaping and SDF layout engine for F#.\n      Targets Wasm-GC backends. Parses cmap/hmtx/kern/GPOS, shapes Latin text,\n      flows glyphs into arbitrary SDF shapes (Circle, Diamond, Triangle,\n      Parallelogram), and emits a WebGPU-ready DrawList.",
